_SimplePhysics_ is a `Java` application that lets you simulate the physics of rigid squares across different landscapes. It includes some amazing landscapes to explore :D.

Feel free to download the program below.

![*Simple physics* app video](/posts/SimplePhysics/Simple_Physics_yt.mp4)


